      "review_note": "",
      "html": "\u003ch2\u003eClosing the S1 centrifuge\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCarlos&#x27;s local tip is to use both hands on top of the lid, aligned with the two latch positions, and press evenly at the same time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf the lid does not latch with normal closing pressure, stop and report it to Haeyeon or the equipment responsible person.\u003c/strong\u003e Do not force or slam the lid, and do not bypass the lid lock. Follow the closing procedure for that centrifuge model before starting a run.\u003c/p\u003e",
      "bodyText": "Closing the S1 centrifuge Carlos's local tip is to use both hands on top of the lid, aligned with the two latch positions, and press evenly at the same time. If the lid does not latch with normal closing pressure, stop and report it to Haeyeon or the equipment responsible person. Do not force or slam the lid, and do not bypass the lid lock. Follow the closing procedure for that centrifuge model before starting a run."
